{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"741771055840100422","content":"Leaf swims over and leaves a note on the door, writen in her usual curly cursive.\n\n```Hello council!\n\nI've recently been granted the ability to give the colony twice as many crops for the next year by enriching the plants within a half mile radius. I'd love to grant this benefit to our own town but I'm wondering if helping the tribes around us first would be more beneficial? I'm afraid I don't know the island's politics all that well at the moment, but Lilia suggested helping the Halfwudgie. Perhaps this would help us ease tensions and get more things done? It takes 8 hours and is a powerful spell, but I'm willing to do it wherever you think is best, just let me know!\n\nBest wishes,\n~Leaf```","created_at":"2020-08-12T04:23:29.960000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-12T04:23:40.366000Z","id":"742961436258467911","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"741771055840100422","content":"Solomon can be seen operating a small pedal powered paddleboat. His lantern swings in the night air. He plods through the flooded town until reaching the town hall. A note and bag full of gold have been nailed to the wall with a dagger.\n\nThe Golden Dawn is openly recruiting. If you think you have what it takes (you don't), go wandering out in the woods by your self. (Post in <#733827207818117144> ) We will find you and make you an offer you can't refuse. As a gesture of good will. I've donated a bag of 2000 gold to you losers. First come, first serve. I promise it's not cursed. C'mon Join the GD. You know you want to. It's time to drop the Zero and get with the Hero!\n\n(First one to claim the gold here gets it and all that might entail.)","created_at":"2020-08-12T08:06:48.286000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-12T08:10:04.380000Z","id":"743017632910803065","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
