{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"741771055840100422","content":"\"First. The flooding, some of us believe securing the Chinnokin temple will reduce this. Second, if the temple does not reduce the flooding, then we will need to relocate as a town.. Thrid, our relations with the other tribed is terribly poor and we need to absolutely try to fix that. And finally.\" She pauses, \"We need to work together for when the Hunger arrives. We know it's coming. Not when or where but it is. There are two groups dedicated to trying to stop this. I think we need to have any information on the Hunger out in the open, even if these two groups have different plans we all have the same goal here. To survive and to live. That is our biggest threat and we can't do anything to prepare if we are all fighting over meaningless politics.\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T20:44:08.985000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-12T20:44:54.632000Z","id":"743208225016381603","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
